    note for ResearchLoopState "Python 声明：TypedDict(total=False)，所有键均可选"

    ResearchLoopState *-- LoopCursor : loop_cursor
    ResearchLoopState *-- EpisodeBudget : budget
    ResearchLoopState *-- ApprovalState : approval_state
    ResearchLoopState o-- AuthorizationEnvelope : authorization_envelope
    ResearchLoopState o-- ToolCallRecord : tool_records
    ResearchLoopState ..> ExternalContracts : 引用业务契约
    ResearchLoopState ..> ResearchLoopSnapshot : 投影
    ResearchLoopSnapshot o-- InterruptPayload : 可选中断
    InterruptPayload ..> ResumePayload : 由用户恢复
